    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That makes sense. Regarding the fire suppression efficacy, could you elaborate on the specific challenges of sensor placement and detection in these high-density setups? I'm concerned about how \"hidden\" or hard-to-reach areas might delay a response if a small leak or reaction starts in the middle of a rack.",
